# 
# The portal in the gazebo roof is only there with the Amber vision on,
# and coming home from a chapter it is off -- Roxy's own portal turns it
# off on the way in. The chain that turns it back on starts at a state
# only the telephone sets, and answering the telephone trims itself out of
# the haunt pool, so it rings once in the whole game. This is the third
# thing the walk does by hand; WORKLOG 155 has the working.
