# 
# The way back lands on `Ggaz_Reentry`, whose only plate is a blurred,
# colour-shifted picture of the gazebo -- `G_REENTRY_LOADPICT`, drawn
# against a palette of its own called `reentry.WIN`. It is what the
# game shows while it comes back through, and its one hotspot covers
# the whole frame: click anywhere and the montage carries on.
